polls or the polls were wrong in 2016.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.450
Polls were basically right.

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:15.140
Nationally, they said Hillary would win by
three.

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.950
She basically won by three.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:20.490
But this is not my opinion of whether the
polls are accurate.

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:25.780
What I'm telling you is, look, in history,
when people are winning every poll and everybody

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:27.390
else has dropped out.

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:28.860
They don't end their campaigns.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:31.420
